This is a SMILE experiment (`@nyuccl/smile-nuxt`, a Nuxt 4 module). Follow
`AGENTS.md` in the project root: it has the project layout, the API and the
conventions.

SMILE's full docs, for the installed version, are in
`node_modules/@nyuccl/smile-nuxt/dist/docs/`. Start with `INDEX.md` there,
and search with the path given explicitly (node_modules is gitignored). When
the docs and the code in `node_modules/@nyuccl/smile-nuxt/dist/runtime/`
disagree, the code wins.
